    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, the anxiety thing doesn't really feel right. it's more like... clarity. like, last week i was at this meetup and i mentioned this one specific concept about how people connect, and literally everyone just went silent. like, dead quiet. and then, almost as if we were all on the same wavelength, three different people started talking about the exact same thing, but from completely different angles. it wasn't just that they were listening, it felt like my words were the catalyst for something they were all already sensing but couldn't express. it felt less like a social skill and more like i was tapping into a frequency. does that make any sense? like, could there be a purpose to why this is happening to me now?",
